<IncidentDef>
    <defName>Nephila_Clutchmother</defName>
    <label>nephilitic fog</label>
    <targetTags>
      <li>Map_PlayerHome</li>
    </targetTags>
    <workerClass>IncidentWorker_MakeGameCondition</workerClass>
    <category>Misc</category>
    <pointsScaleable>true</pointsScaleable>
   	<earliestDay>0</earliestDay>
    <gameCondition>NephiliticFogCondition</gameCondition>
    <letterDef>ThreatSmall</letterDef>
	<letterLabel>nephilitic fog</letterLabel>
	<letterText>It starts with a strange wind, kicking up white dust from some distant land. The dust sticks to the lungs and fills the air with a faint, sickly sweet smell. As the dust storm becomes intense enough to make it difficult to see, a large, snakelike creature emerges. It's abdomen is bulbous and swollen and it's clear that it is soon to give birth. The storm will pass within a week, but the serpent seems to be looking to nest. Deal with it swiftly or prepare for the worst.</letterText>	
    <baseChance>0.12</baseChance>
    <minRefireDays>90</minRefireDays>
    <minDifficulty>2</minDifficulty>
    <!--<durationDays>2.5~7.5</durationDays>-->
    <durationDays>1.5~5.0</durationDays>	
    <tale>NephiliticFog</tale>
  </IncidentDef>

